{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"はーい本日は質問返し。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/22/9325630/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいーーよねなんだか愛しいよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゼリビーンズをバラまいていわゆすオシャレに撮ってみた愛未。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかね、今日やったら漫画が読みたくなったの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"珍しいでしょ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん、しかもキュンキュンしちゃうような漫画ね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本屋さんで思わず買っちゃったよね、ガハ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついでにviviも買ったぜぁっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今宵は夜更かししない程度に読み明かすからよろしくね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/22/9325630/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダブルメガネ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返しするねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．コンビニで売っている\"あんまん\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こしあん派？ つぶあん派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ、つぶあん派だよーう(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つぶつぶしてんの可愛いよね！は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、寝る前になんて呪文を唱えて枕を叩くとあみあみが夢に出てきてくれますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ、美女おいでーって言ってくれたら出演してあげるー。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、あみあみはもう上京して1人暮らししてるのー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ、神奈川だから上京してないよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、突然ですが、あみちゃんは、日村派？それとも、設楽派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ、えーーそれは難しい。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"設楽派でもあり日村派でもある。ダハ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q  あみあみの所に握手しに行っていい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い過ぎて失神したらごめんね!その時は看病してくれる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A、オムライス作ってあげるー笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、  はじめまして。今日あみあみにめっちゃ似た人がいて、能條さんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞いたら違うみたいな顔されました...ほんとに別人ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A、んーー聞かれてないからちがうかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q  あ、来週から修学旅行で沖縄なんだけど、あみあみは修学旅行でどこいったの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A、あみは、ハワイに行ったよーー！！！さすがにテンション上がった能條上々"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q 、 彼女できました！彼女できたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみとは握手し続ける予定です！それでも大丈夫？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A、うん！全然いいんだで！おいでーーー  (๑･ิټ･ิ๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、  最近あった良い事、悪い事は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A、昨日のロケ弁のサムギョプサルがめちゃくちゃ美味しかったんだー！これが良いことでしょ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと悪い事はー......ないっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、  のぎとこ？今観たよ 制服のマネキンどの辺で歌ってる？教えて下さい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A、『黙り込んだ僕らのとこへ～』と『答えを出すな』ってとこ歌ってるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q 、 つい四日前誕生日でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみが誕生日迎えたとき、友達や親からもらった嬉しい言葉はなんだった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A、「生まれてきてくれてありがとう。わたしはどんな時でもあみの味方だよ」ぅぅう～～～～感動だあー  (´༎ຶ۝༎ຶ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q 、 そいえばあみあみはどうぶつの森やらないの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A、うん、最近いいなーって思ってる。。 ( ◞˟૩˟)◞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q 、 あみあみは寿司屋行ったら何食べるのかな～～？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A、焼きハラス！！ありはおいちい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q  あみあみは握手来てくれた人の顔はたいてい覚えてますかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A、うん！覚えてるよー！！！特に個別来てくれた人は絶対覚えてる(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、  ベーグルはどれが一番美味しかった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A、あみ的には、ななみんが選んだエビアボカドが、ぅおっっつって感じだった！おいちいんだ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q 、 あみあみは、コンビニでよく買うものって何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったら教えてね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aなんだろ...お水かグミかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q  、あみあみは嫌いな食べ物とかありますか？好き嫌いしない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A、嫌いな食べ物はあいつだ！レバーだっ！！！それ以外は食べれる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q 、 乃木どこでふられた河童のモノマネみたいな感じの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ムチャ振りを握手会でしてもいい？てか、するけど良い？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A、へーいどんとこーいっ！！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/22/9325630/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鼻先がつべてっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はロケだーい楽しみだーいおおれぇい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張るよもちろん。"}],"source":"archive"}